---
import BookLayout from "../../../layouts/BookLayout.astro";
---

<BookLayout title="Chapter 1 — What is Data?">

  <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-blue-600">
    PART 1 / FOUNDATIONS / CHAPTER 1
  </p>

  <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold">
    What is Data?
  </h1>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold">
      Learning Objectives
    </h2>

    By the end of this chapter, you will understand:

    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>What data means.</li>
      <li>Different types of data.</li>
      <li>Why organizations use data.</li>
      <li>How Data Analytics creates business value.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold">
      Real-world Story
    </h2>

    Imagine an online shop receiving 1,000 orders
    every day. How can its owner discover the best-selling
    products, customer preferences and lost sales?

    The answer begins with data.
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 p-6">
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold">
      Knowledge Check
    </h2>

    <p>What is the primary purpose of Data Analytics?</p>

    <button class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-blue-700
                   px-4 py-2 text-white"
            onclick="alert('Think about how data supports better decisions!')">
      Check the lesson
    </button>
  </section>

</BookLayout>